# Doctrine forbids committing these. Enforced by scripts/check-ignore-contract.sh
# after a saved plan carrying an OAuth client secret reached a public repository.
# A .tfplan is a zip containing tfstate, so it carries every sensitive variable that
# went into it — the same bytes as *.tfstate in a different wrapper.
